            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Pick Aether Spirits with a type advantage against the opponent when fighting."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Praise your Aether Spirit often."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Seek out opponents at your level."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• When you see an attack coming, remember to loudly warn your Aether Spirit to dodge."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Decorate your terminal beautifully, it's best to use Geomorrow Geomarrow ore."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• If you come across Hook the Great of The Moles, remember to shout: \"Pitch-Dark Hook the Great.\""
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Collect 151 Aether Spirits."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Do one hundred set sit-ups a day."
              }
            ]
          },
